  "title": {
    "rendered": "Container Offices for Sale in East Delhi"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>If you need a container office in East Delhi, SAMAN Portable manufactures and supplies steel-framed container offices across the East Delhi belt — Laxmi Nagar, Preet Vihar, Mayur Vihar, Shahdara and Anand Vihar — and the wider Delhi NCR. Each unit is built at our factory and delivered ready to use, which makes it well suited to construction site management, retail expansion and quick-deployment office needs where building from scratch is slow or impractical.</p>\n\n<h2>Container Offices for Sale in East Delhi</h2>\n<p>A container office is a factory-built steel cabin that works as an office, site cabin or retail counter without any permanent foundation. For East Delhi sites and shopfronts, it arrives finished, can be used immediately, and can be relocated when the project moves. SAMAN supplies 10ft, 20ft and 40ft units on an MS steel frame, customised to your layout.</p>\n\n<h2>Container office sizes we supply</h2>\n<p>Three standard footprints, each customised internally for the use.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>Size</th><th>Typical use</th><th>Fit-out</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>10ft</td><td>Site supervisor cabin, sales kiosk, single-desk office</td><td>Door, window, lighting, power points</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20ft</td><td>Site management office, retail unit, team office for 4–6</td><td>AC provision, partitions, storage, workstations</td></tr>\n<tr><td>40ft</td><td>Larger office or combined office-and-store, multi-room layout</td><td>Multiple rooms, washroom provision, networking</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All units are built on an MS steel frame to IS 2062, with insulated wall and roof panels. Stackable and relocatable configurations are available where site access allows.</p>\n\n<h2>Why buy your container office direct from SAMAN</h2>\n<p>SAMAN POS India Private Limited is a manufacturer, not a marketplace or reseller. Buying direct keeps price, build quality and after-sales support with one company.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Factory-built quality:</strong> MS steel frame to IS 2062; ISO 9001:2015 certified.</li>\n<li><strong>Backed warranty:</strong> 5 years structural frame and base + 1–2 years finishing + 20–25 years engineered service life.</li>\n<li><strong>Clear logistics:</strong> delivery from ₹3,000, typical transit 3–5 days, returns within 7 days of delivery/installation.</li>\n<li><strong>Built for the job:</strong> site-management, retail and office layouts customised before dispatch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Delivery and installation in East Delhi</h2>\n<p>We deliver finished container offices across East Delhi and the wider NCR from our North India manufacturing unit. Because each cabin arrives structurally complete, installation on a prepared, level surface is quick and there is no drawn-out on-site construction. The unit can also be lifted and repositioned later — practical for construction sites that shift and for retail trials that scale up.</p>\n\n<h2>Get a container office quote in East Delhi</h2>\n<p>Share the size, layout and the East Delhi location, and we will send current pricing and a delivery estimate. Price depends on size, fit-out and distance, so we quote against your real requirement. <a href=\"https://www.samanportable.com/product-category/container-offices\">Browse our container office options</a> to begin.</p>\n<p><strong>Call +91 62009 09435</strong> or use <strong>Send Enquiry</strong> for a quote to your East Delhi site.</p>\n\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<br>\n<h3>Which container office sizes are available in East Delhi?</h3>\n<p>We supply 10ft, 20ft and 40ft container offices and customise the layout — from a single-desk site cabin to a larger multi-room office or office-cum-store.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How quickly can a unit be delivered to East Delhi?</h3>\n<p>Units are factory-built and typically reach East Delhi and NCR sites within a 3–5 day transit window once the order and layout are confirmed. Delivery starts from ₹3,000.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Can it be used as a construction site office?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Container offices are a common choice for site management — they arrive finished, need no foundation, and can be relocated when the project moves.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>What warranty do I get?</h3>\n<p>5 years on the structural frame and base, 1–2 years on finishing, and a 20–25 year engineered service life (the engineered life of the structure, not a warranty period).</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Are these new or used containers?</h3>\n<p>New only — manufactured on an MS steel frame to IS 2062. We do not supply second-hand or refurbished units.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How do I get a price?</h3>\n<p>Call +91 62009 09435 or use Send Enquiry with your size, layout and East Delhi location, and we will quote against your requirement.</p>",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>Discover how East Delhi&#8217;s top businesses use SAMAN Portable&#8217;s container offices for retail expansion and site management in Shahdara, Laxmi Nagar &amp; Mayur Vihar. Fast setup, AC-ready units!</p>\n",
    "protected": false
